 *
 * Research backing:
 * - UN World Population Prospects 2024
 * - Sub-Saharan Africa: 4.5 children/woman, growing fast
 * - East Asia: 1.0-1.3 children/woman, declining (South Korea 0.72)
 * - Europe: 1.5 children/woman, aging + declining
